Stage 5E.4.3 live verified contract-schedule registration gate.

This marker allows the unified workflow to install migration 0035 only on a push to main.
The migration must not create, infer, backfill, supersede, or otherwise change any live loan schedule, installment, or payment allocation.
Existing loans remain exactly as they were before installation until Management explicitly verifies signed-contract terms through the protected registration workflow.
Automatic Default/Non-default classification, ECL/account 1190, and General Ledger posting remain disabled.
